cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Thunderball: DISCO VOLANTE — Special-Agent Mission Software"
abstract: >-
  BOND film package implementing deterministic special-agent mission software
  for the underwater nuclear-recovery operation from Thunderball (1965):
  dive planning (Bühlmann ZH-L16A decompression, air budget), NATO convoy
  integrity analysis, and submersible range/endurance logistics, exposed
  through the frozen bond_api MissionProvider protocol.
authors:
  - family-names: Friedman
    given-names: Daniel Ari
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6232-9096"
    affiliation: "Active Inference Institute"
keywords:
  - dive planning
  - Bühlmann decompression
  - convoy integrity
  - submersible logistics
  - deterministic mission software
